{"seq":2,"slug":"science","title":"科学探索","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/core-contributions/science","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"anatomy-and-the-human-body","title":"解剖与人体","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/core-contributions/science/anatomy-and-the-human-body","wordCount":1614,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"observing-nature","title":"观察自然","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/core-contributions/science/observing-nature","wordCount":1571,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 科学探索\n\n达·芬奇以艺术家的眼光与科学家的严谨，深入探索自然的奥秘。本章考察其科学成就。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"解剖与人体\"——他亲手解剖、绘制精美图谱，揭示人体奥秘的惊人探索。第二篇文档讲述\"观察自然\",呈现他对水、地质、天文等自然万物孜孜不倦的观察。\n"}